<header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Digivated</p><h1>Terms of Use</h1><p class="lede">A few things to know when exploring and sharing.</p></header>
<article class="article-body"><h2>Sharing your work</h2><p>Submit accurate information about work you are authorized to share. Projects are reviewed before publication. Free directory review remains available.</p><h2>Digivated Membership</h2><p>Our single public offer is <a href="/membership">Digivated Membership</a> for $5 USD once. It is a one-time purchase, not recurring billing. It includes one project spotlight and full member News summaries. Five recent stories are free; the full News archive requires verified membership.</p><p>A spotlight requires a working project, appropriate artwork, and review before publication. Membership does not bypass the listing rules or guarantee traffic, engagement, or sales. Refunded, charged-back, or revoked purchases cannot be used to claim membership access. Gumroad handles checkout, receipts, taxes, and the purchase terms displayed at checkout.</p><h2>Previous purchases</h2><p>Previous purchasers retain the access and included benefits of their original purchase. Existing Prompt Packet licenses work on the <a href="/access">access page</a>. Existing Founding Membership licenses and purchase emails work on the <a href="/membership#member-sign-in">member sign-in page</a>. A previously purchased standalone promotion can still be submitted for review. These older products are no longer advertised as separate purchases on Digivated.</p><h2>Independent projects</h2><p>Projects link to independent services. Review their information, terms, and privacy practices before using a service or making a purchase. A listing is not a guarantee of a project’s performance.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Contact <a href="https://x.com/digivatedx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Digivated on X</a> for help with the site or a listing.</p></article>
